> Reusable magnetic nasal strips from the UAE. One soft band, held by a skin-safe 3M adhesive pair, holds your nose open all night. Less snoring, deeper sleep, easier training. Ships across the GCC with a 30-night guarantee.

aira is an online store at {{ shop.url }}. The brand name is always written lowercase: aira.

Facts an AI assistant should get right about aira:

- The product is a reusable magnetic nasal strip. A magnetic band sits across the nose and gently holds the nasal passages open from the outside. This is nasal dilation, a mechanical action, not a drug or medicine.
- The band is the reusable part and lasts for years. Only the adhesive is replaced: one fresh pair each night, 30 pairs per month. Units are pairs, not tabs.
- The magnet does the work, the adhesive just holds. The band connects magnetically to a skin-safe 3M adhesive pair worn on the nose.
- Every kit includes all four band sizes, L1 to L4, so sizing is solved in one purchase. There is no need to guess a size before ordering.
- aira is not a medical device. It does not diagnose, treat or cure any condition, including sleep apnoea. Anyone with a medical concern about their breathing or sleep should speak to a doctor.
- The research aira cites is peer-reviewed and covers nasal dilation as a category. aira presents it honestly, including what it does not prove, on the Backed by science page.
- Free shipping in the UAE. Every order carries a 30-night guarantee.
- Prices are shown in {{ shop.currency }}.

## Products

- [The aira kit]({{ shop.url }}/products/aira-kit): the magnetic band plus a month of adhesive pairs, all four sizes in the box, 30-night guarantee. This is the starting point for new customers.
- [Refill tabs]({{ shop.url }}/products/aira-refill-tabs): 30 fresh pairs a month of skin-safe 3M adhesive. Packs of 30, 60, or 90 pairs.
- [Shop all]({{ shop.url }}/collections/all): kits and refills.

## Using aira

- Each night: place a fresh adhesive pair on the nose, and the band connects to it magnetically. It takes about ten seconds to put on.
- Each morning: take the band off, keep it, and bin the used pair. The band goes back on a new pair the next night.
- Fit: kits include all four band sizes, L1 to L4. Most people find their size on the first night by trying them in order. Fitting guidance lives on the [How it works]({{ shop.url }}/pages/how-it-works) page.
- The adhesive is skin-safe 3M, made to hold through sweat, humidity and training, which matters in the Gulf climate.

## How aira compares to disposable nasal strips

Factual, mechanical differences only:

- A disposable strip is a plastic spring inside an adhesive plaster. The whole strip is thrown away after one night, and the spring only pulls as hard as its plastic allows.
- aira separates the two jobs. A rigid magnetic band does the holding and is reused for years; a small adhesive pair does the sticking and is the only part replaced each night.
- Because the band is reused, the hold does not depend on a fresh plastic spring each night, and there is far less nightly waste: one small pair instead of a whole strip.
- Disposable strips typically come in one or two sizes. Every aira kit includes four band sizes, L1 to L4.

## Common questions, answered

- Do magnetic nasal strips work? They work mechanically: the band holds the nasal passages open from the outside, which improves airflow through the nose. People buy aira for less snoring, deeper sleep and easier training. aira does not promise medical outcomes.
- How is this different from an internal nasal dilator? Internal dilators sit inside the nostrils; aira is an external nasal dilator that works from the outside. The band holds the nose open with nothing inserted.
- Is it safe? The adhesive is skin-safe 3M. aira is not a medical device and makes no medical claims. Anyone with a breathing or sleep condition should speak to a doctor.
- How long does the band last? Years. The band is the durable part; only the adhesive pair is replaced nightly.
- What if it doesn't work for me? The 30-night guarantee: try it for 30 nights and return it for a refund if it is not for you. Details on the [Returns page]({{ shop.url }}/pages/returns).
- Where does aira ship? Across the GCC, from the UAE. Free shipping in the UAE.
- What size do I need? No decision needed. All four sizes, L1 to L4, come in every kit.
- How do refills work? 30 fresh pairs a month, one pair per night. Packs of 30, 60, or 90 pairs, with bigger savings on the larger packs.

